# Transformers.js imports onnxruntime-common as a phantom (transitive) dependency
# in its node build. pnpm's strict linking hides it, so hoist onnxruntime* to the
# root node_modules to make the node-side NER eval (packages/ner/eval) work.
# Browser builds are unaffected (Vite bundles transformers directly).
public-hoist-pattern[]=*onnxruntime*
